+# LEARNED automatically the first time the server rejects a request — thereafter
+# every request is pre-trimmed to the discovered cap, keeping the most-recent
+# frames (including the current observation) and dropping the oldest images while
+# preserving their text. This turns a fatal abort into graceful visual-memory
+# degradation with a clear warning.
